[2.350707,"o","\u001b[39;49m\u001b]104\u0007\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4l\u001b[?7h\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33mSelect an option:\r\u001b[2d\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[0;2m  ↑↓ navigate  ENTER/SPACE select  ESC cancel\r\u001b[4d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[32m → (●) Configure 🖥️  CLI  (17/27 enabled)\u001b[5;4H\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m(○) Reconfigure an existing tool's provider or API key\u001b[6;4H(○) Configure shared metrics  (off)\u001b[7;4H(○) Done\u001b[?1h\u001b=\u001b[39;49m\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33mTools for 🖥️  CLI\r\u001b[2d\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[0;2m  ↑↓ navigate  SPACE toggle  ENTER confirm  ESC cancel  ← previous\r\u001b[4d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[32m → [✓] 🔍 Web Search & Scraping  (web_search, web_extract)\u001b[5;4H\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m[✓] 🌐 Browser Automation  (navigate, click, type, scroll)\u001b[6;4H[✓] 💻 Terminal & Processes  (terminal, process)\u001b[7;4H[✓] 📁 File Operations  (read, write, patch, search)\u001b[8;4H[✓] ⚡ Code Execution  (execute_code)\u001b[9;4H[✓] 👁️  Vision / Image Analysis  (vision_analyze)  [no API key]\u001b[10;4H[ ] 🎬 Video Analysis  (video_analyze (requires video-capable model))\u001b[11;4H[✓] 🎨 Image Generation  (image_generate)\u001b[12;4H[ ] 🎬 Video Generation  (video_generate (text/image/reference))\u001b[13;4H[ ] 🐦 X (Twitter) Search  (x_search (requires xAI OAuth or XAI_API_KEY))\u001b[14;4H[✓] 🔊 Text-to-Speech  (text_to_speech)\u001b[15;4H[✓] 📚 Skills  (list, view, manage)\u001b[16;4H[✓] 📋 Task Planning  (todo_list)\u001b[17;4H[✓] 💾 Memory  (persistent memory across sessions)\u001b[18;4H[ ] 🧩 Context Engine  (runtime tools from the active context engine)\u001b[19;4H[✓] 🔎 Session Search  (search past conversations)\u001b[20;4H[✓] ❓ Clarifying Questions  (clarify)\u001b[21;4H[✓] 👥 Task Delegation  (delegate_task)\u001b[22;4H[✓] ⏰ Cron Jobs  (create/list/update/pause/resume/run, with optional attached skills)\u001b[23;4H[ ] 🏠 Home Assistant  (smart home device control)  [no API key]\u001b[24;4H[ ] 🎵 Spotify  (playback, search, playlists, library)\u001b[25;4H[ ] 🤖 Yuanbao  (group info, member queries, DM)\u001b[26;4H[✓] 🖱️  Computer Use (macOS/Windows/Linux)  (background desktop control via cua-driver)\u001b[27;4H[ ] 🔌 A2A  (A2A (Agent-to-Agent) protocol v1.0 support for Hermes Agent — both directions of the\u001b[28;1H"]
